  "worked_solution": "The left-hand side is a perfect square. Therefore, we can solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-1)^{2} & =-64 \\\\ x-1 & =\\pm \\sqrt{-64} \\\\ x-1 & =\\pm 8\\,\\text{i} \\\\ x & =1\\pm 8\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has two solutions, $x=1+8\\,\\text{i}$ and $x=1-8\\,\\text{i}.$",
